    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to step into the shoes of a <strong>Luthier </strong> turned warrior. Will you master the power of your guitars, conquer the dungeons, and become the ultimate guitar hero? The stage is set, and the spotlight is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/8be9510f1af7806c32b4109180aba3ad.webp?t=1752706699\" width=617 height=57 /></span>Luthier is an action roguelike where you dive into dungeons, face off against cursed souls, and collect resources. Use these resources to craft a variety of powerful guitars, each with its own unique ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/f53136d53dcfc5b136b24e5ed1084896.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/f53136d53dcfc5b136b24e5ed1084896.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/f53136d53dcfc5b136b24e5ed1084896.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/25f0773012d655eb023e61a78c12fd02.webp?t=1752706699\" width=617 height=57 /></span>Battle cursed spirits and collect materials as you strive to reach the final boss in the dungeons. Acquire new skills in each dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/1cdaf1ea4577564150b5c7a5948c445e.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/1cdaf1ea4577564150b5c7a5948c445e.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/1cdaf1ea4577564150b5c7a5948c445e.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/9e7e1a3679f083a39965d6d56da39e77.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/9e7e1a3679f083a39965d6d56da39e77.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/9e7e1a3679f083a39965d6d56da39e77.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/c721ac5961f39323bd45faab04083451.webp?t=1752706699\" width=617 height=57 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/d38b933145afb508bec5dda8f8cc3336.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/d38b933145afb508bec5dda8f8cc3336.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/d38b933145afb508bec5dda8f8cc3336.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/e76d8f11d4d5cd985ad65a86992cba94.webp?t=1752706699\" width=617 height=57 /></span>As the owner of a guitar store, you'll not only forge and sell guitars but also upgrade your shop and character. Manage your shop, set prices, and attract customers to earn money. Use your earnings to enhance your abilities, making you a ultimate guitar hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/671507123c13f13c7fd044f56746c0c1.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/671507123c13f13c7fd044f56746c0c1.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/671507123c13f13c7fd044f56746c0c1.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/dc19469e0facc8368930fbbb3a535a42.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/dc19469e0facc8368930fbbb3a535a42.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/dc19469e0facc8368930fbbb3a535a42.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to step into the shoes of a <strong>Luthier </strong> turned warrior. Will you master the power of your guitars, conquer the dungeons, and become the ultimate guitar hero? The stage is set, and the spotlight is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/8be9510f1af7806c32b4109180aba3ad.webp?t=1752706699\" width=617 height=57 /></span>Luthier is an action roguelike where you dive into dungeons, face off against cursed souls, and collect resources. Use these resources to craft a variety of powerful guitars, each with its own unique ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/f53136d53dcfc5b136b24e5ed1084896.poster.avif?t=1752706699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/f53136d53dcfc5b136b24e5ed1084896.webm?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/f53136d53dcfc5b136b24e5ed1084896.mp4?t=1752706699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3052870/extras/25f0773012d655eb023e61a78c12fd02.webp?t=1752706699\" width=617 height=57 /></span>Battle cursed spirits and collect materials as you strive to reach the final boss in the dungeons. Acquire new skills in each dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin